    "detailed_description": "You find yourself locked in your own home, in the middle of a crime scene, and without your recent memories. In this horror scenario, you will find a mysterious visitor wandering around the house and making your escape more and more unlikely.<br>Solve all the challenges and puzzles to escape the danger that surrounds you, find out what happened inside your home, and recover your missing memory fragments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388110/extras/d3ef08c5e34f0ee444acec0465b0b810.poster.avif?t=1699502674\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388110/extras/d3ef08c5e34f0ee444acec0465b0b810.mp4?t=1699502674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Murder Cases is a point-and-click game, with several puzzles that need to be solved to find the outcome of the mysterious events.<br><br>- A story of mysteries and uncertainties: An unknown visitor, missing memories, and a case that needs to be solved.<br>- Captivating visuals: With an ink drawing aesthetic, the graphics create an atmosphere of contrast and melancholy.<br>- Intriguing soundtrack: Songs that were composed to set the story with an ambiance of mystery and terror.<br>- Lots of challenges: A whole house to explore, lots of challenges to solve until you find the final answer to your questions<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388110/extras/28b9010f2345ec7f168f0c90341bca2e.poster.avif?t=1699502674\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388110/extras/28b9010f2345ec7f168f0c90341bca2e.webm?t=1699502674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s